  "_comment": "Google service account JSON key. Replace placeholders with real values from Google Cloud Console > IAM > Service Accounts > Keys. Do NOT commit the real file. The gitignore entry `configs/google-drive-credentials.json` prevents accidental commit; for Railway, set the GOOGLE_DRIVE_CREDENTIALS_JSON env var with the file's full JSON contents instead.",

  "type": "service_account",
  "project_id": "YOUR_PROJECT_ID",
  "private_key_id": "YOUR_KEY_ID",
